;
; SANE Backend description file for the plustek8200i backend
;
; This backend drives the Genesys GL128 based Plustek OpticFilm 8200i
; (USB 0x07b3/0x1825). The older OpticFilm 8200i (0x07b3/0x130d) uses a
; GL845 and is handled by the genesys backend instead -- the two share a
; model name but not a chipset.
;

:backend "plustek8200i"
:version "1.0"
:manpage "sane-plustek8200i"
:url "https://gitlab.com/sane-project/backends"

:devicetype :scanner

;* Plustek *********************************************************************

:mfg "Plustek"
:url "https://www.plustek.com/"

:model "OpticFilm 8200i"
:interface "USB"
:usbid "0x07b3" "0x1825"
:status :good
:comment "Film scanner, transparency only. Colour, Gray, Infrared and Color+Infrared modes; 300-7200 dpi; 8 and 16 bit. The infrared channel drives dust and scratch removal (--ir-clean). GL128 chipset; the 0x130d variant of this model is a GL845 and belongs to the genesys backend."
